% formalizes: def:substance
% definition: Substance
% says: By substance, I mean that which is in itself, and is conceived through itself: in other words, that of which a conception can be formed independently of any other conception.
substance(X) :- in_itself(X), conceived_through_itself(X).
in_itself(X) :- substance(X).
conceived_through_itself(X) :- substance(X).
% A substance is a thing, in the sense of Axiom I's "everything which exists".
thing(X) :- substance(X).
